          <p class="pricing-cta__eyebrow-small">Flat fare FAQ</p>
          <h3>Questions before you book?</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="pricing-cta__faq-note">Built for clarity</span>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-cta__faq-list">
        <article class="pricing-cta__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h4>
            <button class="pricing-cta__faq-button" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-1" id="faq-button-1">
              <span>How does flat-rate ticket reselling work?</span>
              <span class="pricing-cta__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h4>
          <div class="pricing-cta__faq-panel" id="faq-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-1">
            <p>FLATFARE sources discounted airline inventory and offers eligible seats at one transparent fare, so route distance does not change your ticket price.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pricing-cta__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h4>
            <button class="pricing-cta__faq-button" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-2" id="faq-button-2">
              <span>Are there hidden fees at checkout?</span>
              <span class="pricing-cta__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h4>
          <div class="pricing-cta__faq-panel" id="faq-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-2">
            <p>No surprise booking markups. The flat fare shown is the fare model this experience is designed around.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pricing-cta__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h4>
            <button class="pricing-cta__faq-button" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-3" id="faq-button-3">
              <span>Can I choose my destination?</span>
              <span class="pricing-cta__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h4>
          <div class="pricing-cta__faq-panel" id="faq-panel-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-3">
            <p>Yes. You pick the destination you want, then claim a flat-rate seat if inventory is available on that route.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pricing-cta__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h4>
            <button class="pricing-cta__faq-button" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-4" id="faq-button-4">
